==========================================================================================
 ISING HIGH-TEMPERATURE IDENTITY: even subgraphs of K_n = Curie-Weiss Ising Z
==========================================================================================
  Sum_{even S subset E(K_n)} x^|S|  ==  2^{-n} Sum_{s in {+-1}^n} prod_{i<j}(1 + x s_i s_j)
  K_4: even-subgraph gen poly = [1, 0, 0, 4, 3, 0, 0]
        Ising 2^-n sum     = [1, 0, 0, 4, 3, 0, 0]   IDENTITY HOLDS: True
  K_5: even-subgraph gen poly = [1, 0, 0, 10, 15, 12, 15, 10, 0, 0, 1]
        Ising 2^-n sum     = [1, 0, 0, 10, 15, 12, 15, 10, 0, 0, 1]   IDENTITY HOLDS: True
  => the even-graph metagraph E_n IS the combinatorics of the Curie-Weiss Ising model on K_n.
DONE.
